hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1136","On the authority of Ali ibn Sahl al-Ramli, on the authority of Mu’mal ibn Ismail, on the authority of Sulaiman ibn al-Mughirah, on the authority of Thabit, on the authority of Anas, who said: The Messenger of God, may God’s prayers and peace be upon him, found One night, it was said: O Messenger of God, the effect of pain on you is clear. He said: “As for me, I am as you see.” Thank God, I read the long seven stories yesterday."
